[7.405717, "o", "\r\n\r\n  ╭─╮╭─╮\r\n  ╰─╯╰─╯  Copilot v1.0.80 uses AI.\r\n  █ ▘▝ █  Check for mistakes.\r\n   ▔▔▔▔\r\u001b[11B╭──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮\r\r\n│ \u001b[1mConfirm folder trust\u001b[109C\u001b[m│\r\r\n│ ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── │\r\r\n│ ╭──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮ │\r\r\n│ │ ~/work/acme-dashboard\u001b[70C│ │\r\r\n│ ╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯ │\r\r\n│\u001b[130C│\r\r\n│ Copilot can read files in this folder and, with your permission, edit them or run code and shell commands. It will remember your │\r\r\n│  permissions for the rest of this session.\u001b[87C│\r\r\n│\u001b[130C│\r\r\n│ Do you trust the files in this folder?\u001b[91C│\r\r\n│\u001b[130C│\r\r\n│ ❯ 1. Yes\u001b[121C│\r\r\n│   2. Yes, and remember this folder for future sessions\u001b[75C│\r\r\n│   3. No (Esc)\u001b[116C│\r\r\n│\u001b[130C│\r\r\n│ \u001b[1m↑/↓\u001b[m to navigate · \u001b[1menter\u001b[m to select · \u001b[1mesc\u001b[m to cancel\u001b[80C│\r\r\n╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[?7l╯\u001b[?7h"]
